Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,The meeting starts in five minutes. Someone
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.09,0:00:04.18,Default,,0,0,0,,asks what AI changes for your team.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.18,0:00:05.37,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you say?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.37,0:00:08.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Something about transformation. Then look thoughtfully at
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.72,0:00:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,a window.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.68,0:00:12.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Or have an actual answer. What changed,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.24,0:00:14.79,Default,,0,0,0,,why it matters, and what you still
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.79,0:00:15.89,Default,,0,0,0,,need to check.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.89,0:00:19.43,Default,,0,0,0,,That's our conversation on The AI Edge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.43,0:00:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Three perspectives. Useful questions. Occasionally, a useful
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.98,0:00:23.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Rufus.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.49,0:00:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sense of the AI stories shaping
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.07,0:00:28.66,Default,,0,0,0,,your day. Follow The AI Edge wherever
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.66,0:00:29.40,Default,,0,0,0,,you listen.
